       LLS     8                    MQ MINUS                            MCSQR019
       TRA     *+2                                                      MCSQR020
       LLS     7                    MQ PLUS                             MCSQR021
       PAX     0,1                                                      MCSQR022
       LLS     9                    F....B18                            MCSQR023
